        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vengeance</strong> is a fast-paced 2D bullet hell roguelike where survival depends on your reflexes, positioning, and ability to stay calm in chaos. Dive into arenas flooded with enemies, dodge an onslaught of projectiles, and stay alive for as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session ramps up the intensity — no grinding, no inventory, just you against overwhelming odds. The longer you survive, the more brutal it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong><br>• 🌀 Pure bullet hell action – survive wave after wave of relentless enemies<br>• ⏱️ Tight, responsive controls – your movement is your greatest weapon<br>• 🔥 Skill-based progression – improve through mastery, not loot<br>• 🎮 Short, intense sessions – perfect for quick adrenaline bursts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 🎲 <strong>Over 10 unique enemy types</strong> that evolve across levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 👹 <strong>2 handcrafted boss encounters</strong>, each with multiple phases and unique mechanics</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vengeance</strong> is a fast-paced 2D bullet hell roguelike where survival depends on your reflexes, positioning, and ability to stay calm in chaos. Dive into arenas flooded with enemies, dodge an onslaught of projectiles, and stay alive for as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session ramps up the intensity — no grinding, no inventory, just you against overwhelming odds. The longer you survive, the more brutal it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong><br>• 🌀 Pure bullet hell action – survive wave after wave of relentless enemies<br>• ⏱️ Tight, responsive controls – your movement is your greatest weapon<br>• 🔥 Skill-based progression – improve through mastery, not loot<br>• 🎮 Short, intense sessions – perfect for quick adrenaline bursts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 🎲 <strong>Over 10 unique enemy types</strong> that evolve across levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 👹 <strong>2 handcrafted boss encounters</strong>, each with multiple phases and unique mechanics</p>",
